{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1060.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"3b826969195574e34d3d0a7e0ed272f9e0141e9ce3aa13b2742d298540972d11","ja":"ちょいワルな香り","zh":"有点坏坏的气息","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1060.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"8d2cba430691889b02e6065da0a58a1403adaa7f1e284bd4da1ddfa15d5d5c83","ja":"えっと……ちょうど静香ちゃんの役の\nモーガンの香水を考えてて……こんな感じで……。","zh":"那个……我刚才正好在琢磨静香演的\n摩根所用的香水……大概是这种感觉……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1060.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"6fe33f565493d95eb9d3f1443ecd97ea8bb7cb42b341b082aaeb4c87c2f94de3","ja":"さっぱりした香りですね……\nなんだかすごく落ち着いた上品な感じがします♪","zh":"气味很清爽呢……\n感觉十分沉静、典雅♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1060.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"bb8eda236afce109ade889a89c7857f9d688831ca3a25c8e082f2f23ae768e12","ja":"こっちのは、アタシのハーマン役？　なんだろう……\n甘いのと辛いのが混ざってる……のかな？","zh":"这一份，是我演的赫尔曼？感觉是什么呢……\n是甜味和辣味混在一起了……吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1060.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"7ffa75dc92dd238f32aea29893a7ae1a5fbe76330428210472bcc3d1cf9b467d","ja":"……うん！　いい香りだと思うよ！","zh":"……嗯！我觉得味道很好闻哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1060.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"45fb61aed59b4ad52dc6e5ea4bbb180134549344cfd6f36db774a9f89e4268d8","ja":"わ、私も、いい香りだって思います……。\nでも……まだ、何か、足りない気がして……。","zh":"我、我也觉得很香……\n但是……总觉得还缺了点什么……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1060.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"3e078123e05dd359be14923ef0ab7801a6aa1b565eea6c41f080b777ef3b9b7f","ja":"えっ、そうなの！？\nすごくいいと思ったんだけどな……。","zh":"诶，是这样吗！？\n我还觉得挺好的呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1060.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"97adfbb0265378ea8119eb108c2ccbe2ee4fa22b22113ad09aee656eb2086417","ja":"ち、ちょっと、普通すぎる……？\nかなって……。","zh":"有、有点太普通了吗……？\n我在想会不会这样……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1060.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"d5b246323f8c7be42f89c0c48d553bc7fa1b8d580a97836c85a29efa27e96620","ja":"言われてみると……私たちの役って、\nどれもすごく個性的でしたもんね……。","zh":"仔细想想……我们扮演的角色，\n每一个都非常有个性呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1060.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"4643d92d2dba1608f297d0d0e651ff55a6ccc144ac35c454e5b2e6308e08ac0c","ja":"それならもっと……セクシーな感じに\nしてみる……とか？","zh":"那要不要试着……\n走更加性感一点的路线……呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1060.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"e4e969689e41e0688be7a0596378d66abd18a7e69ab46cd88e0b6061bd1977b3","ja":"えっ……、セクシー？","zh":"诶……性感？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1060.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"37ce1cc5c88ee80121d5d53a190f79da7b25d34000563b0e7c79f21fc8d8fc57","ja":"その……あやしげな感じがもっと\nあると……いいのかなって！","zh":"那个……要是能再多一点\n可疑的感觉……就好了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1060.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"7ab369d3a41ffe046f1c4090021183e1fa8be0a22e626311487833701967f027","ja":"なるほど……。アタシたちの役って、\nダークな感じで、人を惹きつけるっていうか……。","zh":"原来如此……我们的角色，\n是那种带着黑暗色彩、吸引人的感觉……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1060.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"099703dc14a18679520c8ddd21a550338417058f8099961bcc64d8a1c54e9be2","ja":"アタシのやった役も、こう……いろんな魅力で、\n人の懐に入っていく感じがしたから！","zh":"我演的角色也是，怎么说呢……感觉是用各种各样的魅力，\n慢慢走进了别人的内心！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1060.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"478da510c4284d3ca426bd76abe1bbef55345abb29bc156e7afdcc61bf7f6ac9","ja":"危険なのに、惹かれてしまう……もしかして\nちょいワルって……そういう、香り……？","zh":"明明很危险，却还是被吸引……难道说，\n微坏的那种感觉……就是这种……气味……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1060.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"327400a324e550a4706217bcfed3f586f2c4001b4062a9d1c9d8d269b4914a5e","ja":"ええと……多分……。\n私も上手くは言えないんですけど……。","zh":"那个……大概是……\n我也说不太好就是了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1060.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"c8ce5f255a3210d0d817e55a40848acd5e2fa3233e582e6c272f45517bf08cb1","ja":"う、ううん……十分だよ……！\nありがとう……！","zh":"没、没什么……已经足够了……！\n谢谢你……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1060.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"7d6aca85e0d8e4af15a99775c1afd5e3322089833fe61e02505a352a1430665a","ja":"そっか……も、もう一回……\n最初から……考えてみますね……！","zh":"这样啊……我、我再重新……\n从头……思考一下看看……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
